# TOEIC Vocabulary Day58

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| efficient | 효율적인 | The new system is highly efficient. |
| convenient | 편리한 | The location is convenient for customers. |
| alternative | 대안 | We need an alternative solution. |
| therefore | 그러므로 | The road was closed; therefore, we took another route. |
| however | 그러나 | The product is expensive; however, it is popular. |
| moreover | 게다가 | The hotel is affordable. Moreover, it is close to the station. |
| otherwise | 그렇지 않으면 | Please leave now; otherwise, you may miss the train. |
| solution | 해결책 | We need to find a solution. |
| complaint | 불만, 항의 | The company received a customer complaint. |
| issue | 문제, 사안 | We need to resolve this issue. |

### 암기 포인트

- alternative solution: 대안책
- find a solution: 해결책을 찾다
- customer complaint: 고객 불만
- resolve an issue: 문제를 해결하다
- otherwise: 그렇지 않으면
- moreover: 게다가
